	"bodyHtml": "<div class=\"d--flex\" style=\"flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n                    \n\n                                        \n                            <div id=\"id-34-85\" class=\"section section__textblock section--none section--padding bg-c--soft-conversion txt-c--nero title-c--nero link-c--nero\">\n      <div class=\"san-container\" data-span=\"full-desktop\">\n                    <div class=\"san-col\" data-span=\"12 desktop-xl-6\">\n        <div class=\"j-content txt--left pb--0 desktop-xl-pb--60\" data-block=\"\" data-type=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"text\">\n          <h1>SNACKS FOR CARING:<br>THE CARE LINE WHICH MAKES YOUR DOG WAG HIS TAIL</h1>\n\n                </div>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n\n  <div class=\"san-col\" data-span=\"12 desktop-xl-6\">\n          <div class=\"j-content txt--left pt--0 desktop-xl-pt--60\" data-block=\"\" data-type=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"text\">\n          <p>As dog owners, we want to spoil our faithful companion with a tasty treat as much as possible. A delicious treat between meals or a well-deserved reward during training. But we also want all those treats to be responsible and healthy!</p><p>After all, we have all become more conscious about our health over the past decades; we exercise more and we pay more attention to our diet. And as dogs are increasingly considered full members of the family, we will also start paying more attention to healthy food and snacks for these housemates.</p>\n\n                </div>\n    </div>\n        </div>\n          </div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                              \n\n<div id=\"id-38-53\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--white title-c--nero link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-caring_snacks1-images-38-53.webp\" alt=\"SNACKS TO TAKE CARE for dogs\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h2>SNACKS TO TAKE CARE</h2><p>Therefore, Voskes' Functional Treats deliberately chose responsible snacks that are not only delicious, but also offer additional healthy benefits.</p><p>These snacks are completely grain- and gluten-free. Pumpkin and red lentils were chosen as healthy sources of carbohydrates. These are low in calories but packed with fibre !&nbsp; Moreover, Functional Treats are rich in vitamins, minerals and natural antioxidants. All our Functional Treats also contain fulvic acid, which enhances nutrient absorption.</p><h3>TIP!</h3><p>These Functional treats are suitable as a tasty snack, but can also be used as a reward during training.</p></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n                            <div id=\"id-34-90\" class=\"section section__textblock section--default bg-c--transparent txt-c--nero title-c--nero link-c--nero\">\n      <div class=\"san-container\">\n                    <div class=\"san-col\">\n        <div class=\"j-content txt--left pb--0 desktop-xl-pb--60\" data-type=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"text\">\n          <h3>THERE ARE 3 VARIETIES OF THESE NOURISHING DOG SNACKS</h3>\n\n                </div>\n    </div>\n                </div>\n\n          </div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                              \n\n<div id=\"id-38-49\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--white title-c--primary link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-2\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-skin__coat1-images-38-49.webp\" alt=\"SKIN &amp; COAT for dogs\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-1\" data-options=\"extra-padding--tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h2>SKIN &amp; COAT</h2><p>These snacks were enriched with salmon and herring protein, flaxseed and salmon broth. These are very good sources of omega-3 fatty acids. These essential fatty acids are necessary nutrients that are not produced by the body itself, but are taken from the diet. Omega 3 contributes to a beautiful and shiny coat. Moreover, it is good for cardiovascular health. Sea buckthorn was added as a good source of vitamin C.</p><a href=\"/en/products/functional-skin-coat\" class=\"btn mt--15 btn--nero btn--normal\">مشاهده محصول</a></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                              \n\n<div id=\"id-38-50\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--transparent title-c--salmon link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-anti_stress2-images-38-50.webp\" alt=\"ANTI STRESS for dogs\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h2>ANTI STRESS</h2><p>Many dogs quickly become stressed or anxious in crowded environments or with loud noises, think fireworks! Our Anti Stress snacks are enriched with pineapple and dried hemp, which have a calming effect. So these snacks are ideal for dogs that are sensitive to stress.</p><a href=\"/en/products/functional-antistress\" class=\"btn mt--15 btn--nero btn--normal\">مشاهده محصول</a></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                              \n\n<div id=\"id-38-51\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--white title-c--chicken link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-2\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-anti_parasitic1-images-38-51.webp\" alt=\"ANTI PARASITIC for dogs\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-1\" data-options=\"extra-padding--tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h2>ANTI PARASITIC</h2><p>These Functional Treats contain a high proportion of ginger and wild garlic. These are special ingredients that have a purifying and anti-parasitic effect. The ideal treat to support your four-legged friend in the fight against fleas and- other unwanted parasites.</p><a href=\"/en/products/functional-anti-parasitic\" class=\"btn mt--15 btn--nero btn--normal\">مشاهده محصول</a></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                              \n\n<div id=\"id-38-52\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--transparent title-c--nero link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-dentastick_–_11-images-38-52.webp\" alt=\"DENTAL SNACKS for dogs\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h2>DENTAL SNACKS</h2><p>Besides our Functional Treats, we also have dental snacks. Voskes Dentasticks are specially designed to care for your furry housemate's teeth. These sticks have a cleansing effect for teeth and help keep gums healthy.</p><a href=\"/en/products/dentastick-medium\" class=\"btn mt--15 btn--nero btn--normal\">مشاهده محصول</a></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            </div>"
